* @title CSNOBOL4 extensions round-trip cleanly
* @expect >>>
* A
* abc
* 65
* 97 33
* Z
* 65
* <<<
          OUTPUT = CHAR(65)
          OUTPUT = CHAR(97) CHAR(98) CHAR(99)
          OUTPUT = ORD('A')
          OUTPUT = ORD('a') ' ' ORD('!')
          OUTPUT = CHAR(ORD('Z'))
          OUTPUT = ORD(CHAR(65))
END
